IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONDS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 X          PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
01 Y          PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
01 NAME-FLD   PIC X(10) VALUE "ABC".
01 FLAG       PIC X.
   88 IS-ON   VALUE "Y".
   88 IS-OFF  VALUE "N" "n".
01 GRADE      PIC 9.
   88 PASSING VALUES 4 THRU 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF X > Y DISPLAY "gt" ELSE DISPLAY "le" END-IF
    IF X IS NOT LESS THAN Y AND X NOT = 3 OR Y >= 4 DISPLAY "complex".
    IF X > 3 AND < 9 DISPLAY "abbreviated".
    IF X = 1 OR 2 OR 3 DISPLAY "any of".
    IF NOT (X > Y) DISPLAY "not".
    IF (X + 1) * 2 > Y DISPLAY "paren expr".
    IF NAME-FLD IS ALPHABETIC DISPLAY "alpha".
    IF X IS NUMERIC AND X IS POSITIVE DISPLAY "numeric".
    IF Y IS NOT ZERO DISPLAY "nonzero".
    IF IS-ON DISPLAY "on" ELSE IF IS-OFF DISPLAY "off" END-IF END-IF
    IF PASSING NEXT SENTENCE ELSE DISPLAY "fail".
    IF X EQUAL Y OR X GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO Y DISPLAY "ge".
    STOP RUN.
